s/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wapira%27s_Crown\" title=\"Wapira's Crown\">Wapira's Crown</a>.</li>\n<li>Healing from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Transfuse_Health\" title=\"Transfuse Health\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/20px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/30px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/40px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Transfuse Health\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/20px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Transfuse_Health\" title=\"Transfuse Health\">Transfuse Health</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li>This effect interacts in the following ways with <a href=\"/wiki/Dip\" title=\"Dip\">dipping</a> and coatings:\n<ul><li>The effect overwrites <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dipped_in_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Dipped in Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_I